Sophia is currently on hiatus from KATSEYE, but HYBE announced earlier this month that she plans to return to group activities in January 2027. She stepped back from the group in August to focus on her mental health, meaning she&#8217;ll miss the full Wildworld Tour, which wraps up at the end of November after a planned 31 arena shows across Europe and North America.

Forgotten Island arrived in theaters on Sept. 25, is now available on digital platforms, and will arrive in 4K UHD, Blu-ray and DVD on Dec. 1 via Universal Pictures Home Entertainment. The Forgotten Island soundtrack also includes music by H.E.R., BINI, SB19, Lea Salonga and more.

